[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
LightCraft opens and saves files through the XDG desktop portal, which
needs a D-Bus session bus.  If your desktop does not start one, run
LightCraft under one, for example with

  dbus-run-session lightcraft

LightCraft renders with Vulkan when a Vulkan driver is installed and
falls back to OpenGL ES (EGL) otherwise.

The denoise, face recognition and AI mask models are not part of the
package: LightCraft downloads them when you ask for them in its settings,
after showing their terms.
EOM
}
]
